  "description": "<p>No matter the weather, Rothco&rsquo;s Micro Fleece All Weather Gloves are the perfect outdoor gloves for a variety of tasks, from raking leaves and shoveling snow to setting up a tent. These insulated gloves are designed to keep your hands warm and dry in all conditions, thanks to their dual-layer micro polyester fleece construction. The lightweight and flexible material ensures comfort and ease of movement. The work gloves feature a tricot lining and open cell foam interior, which enhance breathability and prevent your hands from getting sweaty. Additionally, the black leather palms and fingers provide a reinforced grip, allowing you to maintain dexterity while working. These warm gloves are a reliable choice for anyone who needs to perform outdoor tasks in any weather.</p>",
